'''Dee''' (Japanese: '''ディー''') is one of the [[Ghost Master]]s located in the [[Sealed Fort]], located on [[GR Island]] in [[Pokémon Trading Card Game 2: The Invasion of Team GR!]] Dee can be found in the sixth of the nine statues in the main room. Players who defeat Dee will obtain a Present Pack, which can consist of any card that can be found in a booster pack in the game.

==Big Thunder Deck==
'''Big Thunder Deck''' (Japanese: '''ビッグサンダーデッキ''') is the deck played by Dee. The deck consists of exactly three species of Pokémon, with two being exclusive to the two GBC games. The deck strategy is focused around {{TCG ID|Promotional Card|Zapdos|P10}}.

